                     <note type="comment">The last digit of the signature number (which is written on the top left corner of fol. 2a) is unclear. &lt;&lt;bKaʼ gdams gsung ʼbum phyogs sgrig thengs gnyis paʼi dkar chag [Z5WBK2VV]&gt;&gt;: 68 reports "phyi zha 12," but there is no corresponding item with this signature in the [8H6M69W4]. &#13;
The instance could corresponds, rather, to No. 16358 in the &lt;&lt;'Bras spungs dkar chag [8H6M69W4]&gt;&gt; with signature "phyi zha 15" and the reported title "tshad ma rnam nges le'u gsum pa'i 'grel pa zhig," which corresponds to the colophon of the third chapter in this text (fol. 64a5).&#13;
[8H6M69W4] reports 64 folios (which corresponds to the number on the last folio).</note>
                  </adminInfo>
