      <seg type="shared" xml:id="ex046052025-11-1011-09-10" status="reviewed">          gzhung gi tshig 'chad pa la gnyis thun mong gi mtshan nyid dang po'i lugs rnam par bzhag pa'i dang po ni bdag gaM <expan>gzhan nas</expan> yin te bar ma rang tshig smra ba'i rgol ba bdag dang gzhan bstan bcos <lb edRef="inst:4786" n="22a2"/> mkhan <expan>chen nas</expan> tshad mar khas len pas te yid ches su bzung bya yin te khyod bstan bya'i don gyi dngos po ji lta ba bzhin du mthong ba'i sgo nas ngag 'jug par 'dod  pa yin pa'i phyir de'i tshig nas yin no bar la de 2 kyis smras pa'i tshig chos can rang tshad mar khas len pa pos bstan bya'i don gyi 'bras bur 'dod te bstan <lb edRef="inst:4786" n="22a3"/> </seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab> 
